# Douluo Dalu Terminology Seed

Seeded by the `douluo_dalu` preset. The English spellings follow the Fandom captures of the vault this seed came from. Recheck each term against your own frozen sources before relying on it. Spanish and Portuguese values are proposals (`Status = proposed`) until the curator approves them.

## Measurement & Currency Exchange
| World Unit | Earth Metric / Context Equivalent | Currency Exchange Standard | Status |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 Li (Pinyin: Li) | ~500 meters | 1 Gold Coin = 10 Silver = 1,000 Copper Coins | fanfic convention |
| 1 Zhang (Pinyin: Zhang) | ~3.33 meters | 1 Tael of Gold ~ 100 Days of Commoner Rations | fanfic convention |
| 1 Jin (Pinyin: Jin) | ~500 grams | Standard market grain weight | fanfic convention |

The frozen sources give monthly stipends of 1, 10, and 100 gold coins for Soul Masters, Grandmasters, and Elders. Every silver and copper rate above is a fanfic convention.

## Titles & Honorifics Governance
| Original Term | Spanish Translation (es) | Portuguese Draft (pt-BR) | Rule / Context | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Sect Master (Men Zhu) | Maestro de Secta | Mestre da Seita | Always capitalize when preceding proper name | approved |
| Elder (Zhang Lao) | Anciano | Ancião | Formal court title; never translate as "viejo". Do not use it for the rank Spirit Elder (see the rank table) | approved |
| Senior Brother (Shi Xiong) | Hermano Mayor Marcial | Irmão Sênior | Preserved in martial academies; indicates seniority | approved |
| Junior Sister (Shi Mei) | Hermana Menor Marcial | Irmã Júnior | Preserved in martial academies | approved |

## Pronoun & Social Dynamic Matrix
| Speaker | Target | Pronoun / Register | Social Tone | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|
