## Spirit Rank Ladder
Source: Canon baselines. The word "Spirit" is the preferred form; "Soul Elder" and similar variants are not used.

| English Term | Rank Band | es | pt-BR | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Spirit Scholar | 1-10 | Erudito Espiritual | Erudito Espiritual | proposed |
| Spirit Master | 11-20 | Maestro Espiritual | Mestre Espiritual | proposed |
| Spirit Grandmaster | 21-30 | Gran Maestro Espiritual | Grão-Mestre Espiritual | proposed |
| Spirit Elder | 31-40 | Venerable Espiritual | Venerável Espiritual | proposed |
| Spirit Ancestor | 41-50 | Ancestro Espiritual | Ancestral Espiritual | proposed |
| Spirit King | 51-60 | Rey Espiritual | Rei Espiritual | proposed |
| Spirit Emperor | 61-70 | Emperador Espiritual | Imperador Espiritual | proposed |
| Spirit Saint | 71-80 | Santo Espiritual | Santo Espiritual | proposed |
| Spirit Douluo | 81-90 | Douluo Espiritual | Douluo Espiritual | proposed |
| Titled Douluo (umbrella) | 91-99 | Douluo Titulado | Douluo Titulado | proposed |
| Average Titled Douluo (sub-band) | 91-94 | Douluo Titulado Común | Douluo Titulado Comum | proposed |
| Super (Hyper) Douluo (sub-band) | 95-98 | Douluo Supremo | Douluo Supremo | proposed |
| Limit Douluo (sub-band) | 99 | Douluo Límite | Douluo Limite | proposed |
| Soul Master (generic) | any | Maestro de Almas | Mestre de Almas | proposed |

The es rank Venerable Espiritual keeps the rank apart from the court title Anciano (Zhang Lao).

